        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819250/extras/0e56723d66f24f131d53c4503bd9ba48.avif?t=1757893896\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819250/extras_big/0e56723d66f24f131d53c4503bd9ba48.avif?t=1757893896 width=1560 height=504 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TriggerLand</strong> is a chaotic third-person shooter that throws political correctness out the window and dives headfirst into parody mayhem. Step into a world where overblown stereotypes are your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight through wave-based arenas filled with rednecks, conspiracy nuts, HOA, boomers, Karens, and more—all brought to life with exaggerated voice lines. Every round gets harder, dumber, and funnier</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819250/extras/891f244ecc61a48a45c890bfa2db5710.avif?t=1757893896\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819250/extras_big/891f244ecc61a48a45c890bfa2db5710.webp?t=1757893896 width=1560 height=504 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chaotic Third-Person Action</strong> – Dive into a satirical wave-based survival shooter where nothing is taken too seriously.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Round-Based Survival</strong> – Fight off escalating waves of enemies with unique wave pools that keep each run fresh.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shared Team Economy</strong> – Work together with a common pool of money earned from kills and round progression.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weapon Terminals</strong> – Spend your team’s earnings at buy stations to unlock and upgrade a wide arsenal of guns.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expansive Map Variety</strong> – Battle across multiple themed maps ranging from absurd arenas to chaotic environments filled with humor and danger.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Arsenal</strong> – Wield everything from classic rifles to quirky sidearms, each with distinct stats and playstyles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiplayer Mayhem</strong> – Jump in with friends for fast-paced co-op action where teamwork (and laughter) are the key to survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819250/extras/0d8ae5251c6a0b35cf888a198aebd50d.avif?t=1757893896\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819250/extras_big/0d8ae5251c6a0b35cf888a198aebd50d.webp?t=1757893896 width=1560 height=504 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Party-Game Energy</strong> – A shooter that doesn’t take itself seriously—designed for fun and messing around with buddies.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819250/extras/0e56723d66f24f131d53c4503bd9ba48.avif?t=1757893896\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819250/extras_big/0e56723d66f24f131d53c4503bd9ba48.avif?t=1757893896 width=1560 height=504 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TriggerLand</strong> is a chaotic third-person shooter that throws political correctness out the window and dives headfirst into parody mayhem. Step into a world where overblown stereotypes are your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight through wave-based arenas filled with rednecks, conspiracy nuts, HOA, boomers, Karens, and more—all brought to life with exaggerated voice lines. Every round gets harder, dumber, and funnier</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819250/extras/891f244ecc61a48a45c890bfa2db5710.avif?t=1757893896\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819250/extras_big/891f244ecc61a48a45c890bfa2db5710.webp?t=1757893896 width=1560 height=504 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chaotic Third-Person Action</strong> – Dive into a satirical wave-based survival shooter where nothing is taken too seriously.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Round-Based Survival</strong> – Fight off escalating waves of enemies with unique wave pools that keep each run fresh.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shared Team Economy</strong> – Work together with a common pool of money earned from kills and round progression.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weapon Terminals</strong> – Spend your team’s earnings at buy stations to unlock and upgrade a wide arsenal of guns.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expansive Map Variety</strong> – Battle across multiple themed maps ranging from absurd arenas to chaotic environments filled with humor and danger.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Arsenal</strong> – Wield everything from classic rifles to quirky sidearms, each with distinct stats and playstyles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiplayer Mayhem</strong> – Jump in with friends for fast-paced co-op action where teamwork (and laughter) are the key to survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819250/extras/0d8ae5251c6a0b35cf888a198aebd50d.avif?t=1757893896\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819250/extras_big/0d8ae5251c6a0b35cf888a198aebd50d.webp?t=1757893896 width=1560 height=504 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Party-Game Energy</strong> – A shooter that doesn’t take itself seriously—designed for fun and messing around with buddies.</p>",
